# Built files. All three are rebuilt from laws/, which IS in the repository:
#
#   python ingestion/build.py
#
# laws/ is committed on purpose. The test questions in eval/testset.py point at
# sections by their position within a page, so downloading the pages fresh
# would shift those positions and the scores would stop meaning anything.
